m.numImages\":\"Number of images\",\"chat.settings.form.ideogram.validation.styleReference\":\"Style reference requires 2–5 images\",\"chat.settings.params.magic_prompt\":\"Prompt Assistant (GPT)\",\"chat.settings.form.higgsfield-soul.newCharacter\":\"Create a character\",\"chat.settings.form.ideogram.style.realistic\":\"Realistic\",\"chat.settings.form.flux.rawModeDisabled\":\"Turned off\",\"chat.settings.form.midjourney.weird\":\"Unusual\",\"chat.settings.params.civitai_loras\":\"LoRA\",\"chat.settings.form.runwayFrames.styles.paintedAnime\":\"Anime with drawing effect\",\"chat.settings.form.noise_reduction\":\"Noise reduction\",\"chat.settings.form.runwayFrames.styles.threeDCartoon\":\"3D cartoon\",\"chat.settings.form.ideogram.speed.default\":\"Detail and speed balance\",\"chat.settings.form.midjourney.weight\":\"Support force\",\"chat.settings.form.ideogram.validation.resolutionRequired\":\"Resolution is required\",\"chat.settings.params.sw\":\"Support strength (--sw)\",\"chat.settings.form.ideogram.paletteMembers\":\"Palette members\",\"chat.settings.params.tile\":\"Seamless mode\",\"chat.settings.form.runwayFrames.styles.terracotta\":\"Terracotta\",\"chat.settings.form.runwayFrames.clearStyle\":\"Clear style\",\"chat.settings.form.temperature\":\"Temperature\",\"chat.settings.params.resized_image_url\":\"Resized image URLs\",\"chat.settings.params.resized_image_metadata\":\"Resized image metadata\",\"chat.settings.params.image_size\":\"Detailing\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.validation.imageRequired\":\"At least 1 image required\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.optimized_for\":\"Optimized For\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.engine\":\"Engine\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.creativity\":\"Creativity\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.hdr\":\"HDR\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.resemblance\":\"Resemblance\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.fractality\":\"Fractality\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.sharpen\":\"Sharpen\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.smart_grain\":\"Smart grain\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.ultra_detail\":\"Ultra detail\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.flavor\":\"Flavor\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.scaleLockedAlert\":\"The scale will be fixed at 2x for this flavor\",\"chat.settings.form.magnific.creativePromptMessage\":\"You can guide the upscaling process with a descriptive prompt. If the image you're upscaling is AI-generated, reusing the original prompt here can greatly improve the upscaling quality!\\n<br/><br/>\\nYou can also use your imagination to alter images: for example, transform a city into ruins during the upscaling process (typically after at least 4x upscale), change a person's eye color, or give a portrait the look of a famous person.\\n<br/><br/>\\nIMPORTANT: You can weigh specific parts of the prompt by using a number in parentheses, ranging from 1 to 1.4, like \\\"(beautiful green eyes:1.3)\\\". Magnific AI sometimes ages faces in its outputs. To counter this, adjust your prompt weights, for example: \\\"(young woman:1.3), (cute young face:1.2), (cute:1.2)\\\".\",\"chat.settings.form.grok_image.validation.imageRequired\":\"At least 1 image required\",\"chat.settings.form.flux.validation.kontext_multi\":\"In this mode should be from 1 to 4 images\",\"chat.settings.form.grok_image.validation.onlyOneImage\":\"1 image required\",\"chat.settings.params.choice\":\"Selected image\",\"chat.settings.params.task_id\":\"ID of operation\",\"chat.settings.form.soraImages.quality.high\":\"High\",\"chat.settings.form.soraImages.quality.low\":\"Low\",\"chat.settings.form.soraImages.quality.medium\":\"Medium\",\"chat.settings.params.details_quality\":\"Details\",\"chat.settings.form.luma-image.style-reference-alert\":\"References only work reliably when you specify their role in the prompt. Otherwise, the model will guess, and the result may be less predictable.\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.title\":\"Select area\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxList.empty\":\"No areas selected\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.enableSequential.tooltip\":\"Generate a series of images while preserving a coherent narrative.\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.limitHit\":\"Up to 2 areas per image.\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.enableSequential\":\"Sequential generation\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxList.count\":\"{count} area(s)\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.clearLast\":\"Remove last\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.thinkingMode\":\"Thinking mode\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxList\":\"Area selection\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.hint\":\"Draw a frame around the part of the image you want to change.\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.redo\":\"Redo\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.undo\":\"Undo\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.thinkingMode.tooltip\":\"Enables enhanced reasoning during image generation.\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.clear\":\"Clear\",\"chat.settings.form.wan_image.bboxEditor.infoTooltip\":\"Wan 2.7 will work with the selected area while trying to preserve the rest of the image unchanged. After selecting, describe in the prompt what to do: replace, add, remove or change the object.\",\"chat.settings.form.luma-image.invert-mask.label\":\"Remove object\",\"chat.settings.form.luma-image.style-main-image\":\"Source image\",\"chat.settings.form.luma-image.additional-alert\":\"Turn on to remove the object instead of the background.\",\"chat.settings.form.luma-image.style-main-image-text\":\"Add images and specify in the prompt how each reference should be used.\",\"chat.input.luma-image-placeholder-removeBackground\":\"Add images and specify in the prompt how each reference should be used.\",\"chat.settings.form.grok_image.quality.low\":\"Low\",\"chat.settings.form.grok_image.quality.medium\":\"Medium\",\"chat.settings.form.grok_image.quality.high\":\"Hi