kflows involving code, documents, spreadsheets and tools. It plans each stage, understands how files and materials relate to one another and maintains context throughout extended projects. It’s a strong choice for automation, technical projects and multi-step tasks that need to be carried through to completion.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>working with code and files</li><li>understanding connections across materials</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":2,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":65536,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":false,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"qwen3.7-plus\",\"label\":\"Qwen 3.7 Plus\",\"ai_name\":\"qwen\",\"description\":\"<p>Qwen 3.7 Plus works with text, images, video and on-screen content. It understands interfaces and can use visual references to generate code or continue working on a task. It’s well suited for web development, interface analysis and tasks where visual information needs to be turned into a usable result.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>working with images and video</li><li>code generation from visual references</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":1,\"free_from_sub\":\"vip\",\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":65536,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":false,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"deepseek-r1\",\"label\":\"DeepSeek R1\",\"ai_name\":\"deepseek\",\"description\":\"<p>DeepSeek R1 is built for problems where the solution needs to be logically sound and verifiable. It performs well in mathematical and algorithmic tasks, works within defined constraints, checks intermediate results and helps identify errors in code or calculations. It’s a strong choice for clearly defined problems where reaching the right answer matters as much as validating the solution.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>mathematics and algorithms</li><li>solution verification</li><li>error detection</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":1,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":384000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":false,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":false,\"files\":true,\"images\":false,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[]},{\"id\":\"deepseek-v3\",\"