g>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>multimodal analysis</li><li>software engineering</li><li>analysis across data types</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":2,\"free_from_sub\":\"ultraelite\",\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":65536,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"gemini-3.5-flash\",\"label\":\"Gemini 3.5 Flash\",\"ai_name\":\"gemini\",\"description\":\"<p>Gemini 3.5 Flash is built for fast, iterative work with code and tools. It maintains context across multiple stages, explores alternative approaches and steadily improves a solution throughout longer tasks. It’s a strong choice for software development, prototyping and workflows that involve repeated cycles of planning, execution and refinement.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>iterative development</li><li>coding</li><li>extended multi-step tasks</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":2,\"free_from_sub\":\"elite\",\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":65536,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\