rowser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"label\":\"GPT 5.5\",\"ai_name\":\"chatgpt\",\"description\":\"<p>GPT 5.5 is designed to handle complex workflows autonomously, from the initial task to the final result. It plans the next steps, stays on track during extended work, checks intermediate outputs, and requires fewer follow-up instructions. It’s well suited for programming, research and complex projects that need to be carried through to completion step by step.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>autonomous task execution</li><li>action planning</li><li>result verification</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":3,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"available_subscriptions\":[\"pro\",\"gpt\",\"vip\",\"elite\",\"ultraelite\"],\"min_subscription\":\"pro\",\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":128000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"gpt-5.6-luna\",\"label\":\"GPT 5.6 Luna\",\"ai_name\":\"chatgpt\",\"description\":\"<p>GPT 5.6 Luna is built for fast, high-volume processing of short, repetitive tasks. It’s well suited for summarization, information extraction and classification, translation and generation of multiple content variations. Choose it for workflows that involve many similar requests and require quick, consistent results with efficient resource use.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>high-volume request processing</li><li>summarisation and translation</li><li>creating content variations</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":2,\"free_from_sub\":\"elite\",\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":128000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":false,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"gpt-5.6-sol\",\"label\":\"GPT 5.6 Sol\",\"ai_name\":\"chatgpt\",\"description\":\"<p>GPT 5.6 Sol is designed for the most complex, resource-intensive professional projects. It excels at working with large software systems, conducting in-depth research and solving problems that require advanced reasoning, sustained focus and methodical analysis. It’s well suited for complex workflows where understanding numerous interdependencies is essential to solving challenging and unconventional problems.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>advanced programming</li><li>in-depth research</li><li>long-horizon problem-solving</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":3,\"free_from_sub\":null,\"availabl